> Suppose that there are two stages of memory model interaction.
> 1. Within-conversation: The within-conversation object persists for the length of a conversation. It has a function that is called once per response needed from the AI. For this it is given the AI's last response and the user's response in reply to that. It then returns a chunk of text that can be embedded into the prompt to the AI. It also has a function that can translate the whole conversation to that point into an effective summary.
